  "NewsAgg provides aggregated news, summaries, sentiment analysis, and optional community and AI features for informational purposes. You must use the service lawfully and may not disrupt it, automate abusive traffic, impersonate others, or post unlawful or harmful material.": "NewsAgg 提供彙整新聞、摘要、情緒分析，以及選用的社群與 AI 功能，僅供資訊參考。您必須合法使用本服務，不得干擾服務、透過自動化方式濫用流量、冒充他人或發布違法及有害內容。",
  "You are responsible for activity under your account and for keeping your sign-in methods secure. We may restrict accounts that abuse the service or other users. You may delete your account from account settings.": "您須對帳戶活動負責，並保護登入方式的安全。我們可能限制濫用服務或侵害其他使用者的帳戶。您可在帳戶設定中刪除帳戶。",
  "Original articles, images and trademarks belong to their publishers and creators. NewsAgg summaries are sentences extracted from the original article; sentiment, topics, translations and chat answers are automated. All of them can contain errors and none is financial, legal, medical or other professional advice. Follow the source link before relying on important information.": "原始文章、圖片與商標屬於各媒體與創作者。NewsAgg 的摘要是從原文擷取的句子；情緒、主題、翻譯與問答回覆皆為自動產生，都可能有誤，且不構成財務、法律、醫療或其他專業建議。依賴重要資訊前，請先閱讀原始來源。",
  "You retain ownership of posts you submit and grant NewsAgg permission to display them as part of the service. Do not post content you lack permission to share.": "您保留所提交貼文的所有權，並授權 NewsAgg 在服務中展示。請勿發布您無權分享的內容。",
  "The service is provided on an “as available” basis without a guarantee of uninterrupted operation. To the extent allowed by law, NewsAgg is not liable for losses caused by reliance on aggregated, third-party, or AI-generated content.": "本服務按實際可用狀態提供，不保證不中斷運作。在法律允許範圍內，NewsAgg 不對因依賴彙整、第三方或 AI 產生內容而造成的損失負責。",
  "These terms may be updated as the service evolves. Continued use after an updated effective date means you accept the revised terms.": "這些條款可能隨服務發展而更新。更新生效後繼續使用，即表示您接受修訂條款。",
  "When you create an account, NewsAgg stores your email address, username, authentication details, profile settings, bookmarks, and posts. Passwords are stored only as cryptographic hashes. Google sign-in is used only to verify identity and link the account you approve.": "建立帳戶時，NewsAgg 會儲存您的電子郵件地址、使用者名稱、驗證資料、個人檔案設定、書籤及貼文。密碼僅以密碼學雜湊形式儲存。Google 登入僅用於驗證身分及連結您核准的帳戶。",
  "An essential HttpOnly session cookie keeps you signed in. Active-session records include limited browser and IP information so you can recognize devices and revoke access. Theme, language, news-language mode, cached profile display and per-article chat history may be stored locally in your browser. NewsAgg does not use these features for advertising tracking.": "必要的 HttpOnly 工作階段 Cookie 讓您維持登入。有效工作階段紀錄包含有限的瀏覽器與 IP 資訊，供您辨識裝置及撤銷存取權。主題、語言、新聞語言模式、個人檔案顯示快取及各文章的聊天紀錄可能儲存在您的瀏覽器本機。NewsAgg 不將這些功能用於廣告追蹤。",
  "NewsAgg uses these providers: a self-hosted PostgreSQL database; Cloudflare for the secure tunnel and Turnstile CAPTCHA; Google for sign-in and Gemini translation; Lingva as a short-text translation fallback; Groq for AI chat, which receives your question and up to four passages of the article you are reading; an SMTP provider for account and digest email; and error monitoring when it is enabled. Each provider processes data under its own terms.": "NewsAgg 使用下列服務供應商：自架 PostgreSQL 資料庫；Cloudflare 提供安全通道與 Turnstile 驗證；Google 提供登入與 Gemini 翻譯；Lingva 作為短文字翻譯備援；Groq 提供 AI 問答，會收到您的問題與您正在閱讀文章中最多四段內容；SMTP 供應商寄送帳戶與每日摘要郵件；啟用時另有錯誤監控服務。各供應商依其條款處理資料。",
  "Account information is retained while your account exists or as needed for security and legal obligations. You can update your profile or delete your account from account settings. Browser-stored preferences can be removed through your browser controls.": "帳戶資訊會在帳戶存在期間保留，或因安全與法律義務需要而保留。您可透過帳戶設定更新個人檔案或刪除帳戶。瀏覽器儲存的偏好可透過瀏覽器控制項移除。",
  "NewsAgg uses encrypted connections where available, access controls, rate limits, hashed passwords, and restricted session cookies. No internet service can guarantee absolute security.": "NewsAgg 在可行時使用加密連線，並採用存取控制、速率限制、密碼雜湊及受限的工作階段 Cookie。任何網路服務都無法保證絕對安全。",
